{"chunks": {"ce9c7770_0": {"chunk_id": "ce9c7770_0", "content": "\ud83d\udcf1\nProject Overview\nI want to develop two mobile applications (iOS and Android) using Flutter.\nThe goal is to create a multi-service chatbot ecosystem, where:\n\u25cf One app is for Businesses/Admins (Customers who create chatbots)\n\u25cf One app is for End Users/Consumers (People who use the chatbots)\nBoth apps will be connected through a centralized backend system.\n\ud83c\udfe2\nApp 1: Business/Admin App (Chatbot\nCreator Platform)\n\ud83c\udfaf\nPurpose\nThis app allows businesses/companies to create, manage, and monitor their own AI chatbot\nwithout needing technical expertise.\n\ud83d\udd10\nApp Flow\n1\u20e3 Login & Security\n\u25cf Secure login/signup\n\u25cf Authentication (Email/OTP/2FA)\n\u25cf Company verification (if needed)\n2\u20e3 Dashboard (After Login)\n\nA professional, user-friendly dashboard that shows:\n\u25cf Total user interactions\n\u25cf Number of chatbot entries\n\u25cf Frequently asked questions\n\u25cf AI-generated insights\n\u25cf Analytics and performance metrics\n\u25cf Customer engagement reports\n3\u20e3 Chatbot Creation Process\nWhen a business wants to create a chatbot:\n\u25cf The app asks structured Yes/No questions\n\u25cf The admin enters:\n\u25cb Company details\n\u25cb Services offered\n\u25cb Frequently asked questions (Q&A)\n\u25cb Custom responses\n\u25cf The system provides AI suggestions for:\n\u25cb Improved questions\n\u25cb Better response formats\n\u25cb Automated answer recommendations\n\u25cf Admin can edit/approve AI suggestions\n\u25cf Once satisfied, they publish the chatbot [Context: 4\u20e3 Chatbot Management Features\n\u25cf Edit chatbot responses\n\u25cf Add new FAQs\n\u25cf View user conversations\n\u25cf See AI-generated analytics\n\u25cf Update company information\n\u25cf Enable/disable chatbot\n\ud83c\udfa8 UI Requirements\n\u25cf ]", "subject": "Pddapp", "doc_type": "unknown", "topic": "Project Overview", "difficulty": "intermediate", "source_file": "Pddapp.pdf", "page_number": 1, "chunk_index": 0, "timestamp": "2026-03-02T15:05:36.755357", "word_count": 238}, "47db079f_1": {"chunk_id": "47db079f_1", "content": "4\u20e3 Chatbot Management Features\n\u25cf Edit chatbot responses\n\u25cf Add new FAQs\n\u25cf View user conversations\n\u25cf See AI-generated analytics\n\u25cf Update company information\n\u25cf Enable/disable chatbot\n\ud83c\udfa8 UI Requirements\n\u25cf Modern and professional design\n\u25cf Easy to use\n\u25cf Clean navigation\n\u25cf Business-focused dashboard interface\n\ud83d\udc65\nApp 2: Consumer App (Unified Support\nPlatform)\n\ud83c\udfaf\nPurpose\nThis app allows users to access multiple company chatbots in one single app, instead of\nvisiting each company's website separately.\n\n\ud83d\udd10\nApp Flow\n1\u20e3 Login & Region Selection\n\u25cf User login/signup\n\u25cf Country/region selection\n\u25cf Basic profile setup\n2\u20e3 Home Interface\nAfter login:\n\u25cf Welcome message: \u201cHow can I help you?\u201d\n\u25cf Search bar\n\u25cf Sector/category filters (Banking, E-commerce, Healthcare, Education, etc.)\n\u25cf List of available company chatbots\n3\u20e3 Chat System\nWhen a user selects a company:\n\u25cf Opens chat interface\n\u25cf User types questions\n\u25cf Chatbot responds using:\n\u25cb Data configured in Admin App\n\u25cb AI-enhanced responses\n\u25cf Real-time chat experience [Context: \ud83d\udd04\nSystem Architecture Overview\n\u25cf Admin App creates and manages chatbot data\n\u25cf Data stored in centralized backend\n\u25cf Consumer App fetches and displays available chatbots\n\u25cf Conversations are logged and s]", "subject": "Pddapp", "doc_type": "unknown", "topic": "4\u20e3 Chatbot Management Features", "difficulty": "intermediate", "source_file": "Pddapp.pdf", "page_number": 3, "chunk_index": 1, "timestamp": "2026-03-02T15:05:36.755357", "word_count": 191}, "58933686_2": {"chunk_id": "58933686_2", "content": "\ud83d\udd04\nSystem Architecture Overview\n\u25cf Admin App creates and manages chatbot data\n\u25cf Data stored in centralized backend\n\u25cf Consumer App fetches and displays available chatbots\n\u25cf Conversations are logged and synced back to Admin dashboard\n\u25cf AI layer enhances responses and suggestions\n\ud83e\udde0\nCore Features\n\u25cf Multi-tenant chatbot system\n\u25cf AI-powered response suggestions\n\u25cf Real-time messaging\n\u25cf Analytics dashboard\n\u25cf Searchable chatbot directory\n\u25cf Scalable backend architecture\n\u25cf Secure authentication\n\u25cf Cloud database integration\n\ud83d\udee0\nTechnology Stack\n\u25cf Frontend: Flutter (iOS & Android)\n\n\u25cf Backend: Firebase / Node.js / Django (scalable)\n\u25cf Database: Firestore / PostgreSQL\n\u25cf AI Integration: OpenAI API / Custom LLM\n\u25cf Authentication: Firebase Auth / OAuth\n\ud83d\udca1\nBusiness Vision\n\u25cf One centralized support platform\n\u25cf Businesses don\u2019t need separate support websites\n\u25cf Consumers get all company support systems in one app\n\u25cf AI-driven automation improves customer experience\n1\u20e3 Technical Architecture Document\n\ud83d\udccc\nSystem Overview\nYou are building a Multi-Tenant AI Chatbot Platform consisting of:\n\u25cf Admin App (Business Chatbot Builder)\n\u25cf Consumer App (Unified Support Chat Platform)\n\u25cf Centralized Backend\n\u25cf AI Engine\n\u25cf Analytics Engine\nThe system follows a Scalable Cloud-Based Microservices Architecture. [Context: \ud83c\udfd7\nHigh-Level Architecture\n[Admin Flutter App] [Consumer Flutter App]\n| |\n|-------> API Gateway <----|\n|\n-------------------\n| |\nAuth Service Chatbot Service\n| |\nAnalytics Service AI Engine\n| |\n-------]", "subject": "Pddapp", "doc_type": "unknown", "topic": "System Architecture Overview", "difficulty": "intermediate", "source_file": "Pddapp.pdf", "page_number": 5, "chunk_index": 2, "timestamp": "2026-03-02T15:05:36.756370", "word_count": 222}, "ffd83a2c_3": {"chunk_id": "ffd83a2c_3", "content": "\ud83c\udfd7\nHigh-Level Architecture\n[Admin Flutter App] [Consumer Flutter App]\n| |\n|-------> API Gateway <----|\n|\n-------------------\n| |\nAuth Service Chatbot Service\n| |\nAnalytics Service AI Engine\n| |\n------- Database -------\n\ud83e\udde9\nCore Components\n1\u20e3 Frontend (Mobile Apps)\n\u25cf Built with Flutter\n\u25cf State Management: Riverpod / Bloc\n\u25cf Secure token-based authentication\n\u25cf WebSocket for real-time chat\n2\u20e3 API Gateway\n\u25cf Handles routing\n\u25cf Rate limiting\n\u25cf Request validation\n\u25cf Authentication middleware\n3\u20e3 Backend Services\n\n\ud83d\udd10 Authentication Service\n\u25cf JWT-based login\n\u25cf Role-based access control (Admin / Consumer)\n\ud83e\udd16 Chatbot Service\n\u25cf CRUD chatbot\n\u25cf Manage FAQs\n\u25cf Fetch chatbot data\n\u25cf Store conversations\n\ud83e\udde0 AI Engine\n\u25cf Auto-generate FAQ suggestions\n\u25cf Improve responses\n\u25cf Context-aware replies\n\ud83d\udcca Analytics Service\n\u25cf Interaction count\n\u25cf Query trends\n\u25cf AI insights\n4\u20e3 Database Layer\n\u25cf Primary DB: PostgreSQL / Firestore\n\u25cf Redis: caching\n\u25cf Cloud Storage: logs & attachments\n\n5\u20e3 Hosting\n\u25cf Cloud: AWS / GCP / Azure\n\u25cf CI/CD: GitHub Actions\n\u25cf Containerization: Docker\n2\u20e3 Database Schema Design\n\ud83e\uddd1 Users Table\nusers\n------\nid (PK)\nname\nemail\npassword_hash\nrole (admin / consumer)\ncountry\ncreated_at\n\ud83c\udfe2 Companies Table\ncompanies\n---------\nid (PK)\nadmin_id (FK \u2192 users.id)\ncompany_name\nsector\ndescription\ncreated_at\nstatus\n\ud83e\udd16 Chatbots Table\nchatbots [Context: --------\nid (PK)\ncompany_id (FK \u2192 companies.id)\nbot_name\nbot_description\nstatus\ncreated_at\n\u2753 FAQs Table\nfaqs\n----\nid (PK)\nchatbot_id (FK)\nquestion\nanswer\nai_generated (boolean)\ncreated_at\n\ud83d\udcac Conversati]", "subject": "Pddapp", "doc_type": "unknown", "topic": "High-Level Architecture", "difficulty": "intermediate", "source_file": "Pddapp.pdf", "page_number": 7, "chunk_index": 3, "timestamp": "2026-03-02T15:05:36.756370", "word_count": 234}, "fc0acc87_4": {"chunk_id": "fc0acc87_4", "content": "--------\nid (PK)\ncompany_id (FK \u2192 companies.id)\nbot_name\nbot_description\nstatus\ncreated_at\n\u2753 FAQs Table\nfaqs\n----\nid (PK)\nchatbot_id (FK)\nquestion\nanswer\nai_generated (boolean)\ncreated_at\n\ud83d\udcac Conversations Table\nconversations\n-------------\nid (PK)\nconsumer_id (FK \u2192 users.id)\nchatbot_id (FK)\nstarted_at\nended_at\n\ud83d\udcad Messages Table\nmessages\n--------\nid (PK)\nconversation_id (FK)\nsender (user / bot)\nmessage_text\ntimestamp\n\ud83d\udcca Analytics Table\nanalytics\n---------\n\nid (PK)\nchatbot_id (FK)\ntotal_queries\ntop_question\nai_accuracy_score\nupdated_at\n3\u20e3 System Design\n\ud83c\udfd7\nHigh-Level Design (HLD)\nArchitecture Style:\n\u25cf Microservices\n\u25cf Multi-tenant SaaS platform\n\u25cf Event-driven communication\nCore Goals:\n\u25cf Scalability\n\u25cf Fault tolerance\n\u25cf Low latency chat\n\u25cf High security\nKey Functional Requirements\n\u25cf Businesses create chatbot\n\u25cf AI suggests Q&A improvements\n\n\u25cf Consumers access all bots in one app\n\u25cf Real-time chat\n\u25cf Analytics dashboard\nNon-Functional Requirements\n\u25cf 99.9% uptime\n\u25cf < 1 second response latency\n\u25cf Secure encrypted communication\n\u25cf Scalable to millions of users\n\ud83d\udd2c\nLow-Level Design (LLD)\n1\u20e3 Chat Flow\n1. Consumer selects chatbot\n2. App calls API /chat/start\n3. Server creates conversation ID\n4. Messages sent via WebSocket\n5. AI engine processes context\n6. Bot reply returned\n7. Stored in database [Context: 2\u20e3 AI Suggestion Flow (Admin App)\n1. Admin enters FAQ\n2. API \u2192 AI Engine\n3. AI improves question/answer\n4. Admin reviews\n5. Save to DB\n3\u20e3 Analytics Processing\n\u25cf Every message stored\n\u25cf Scheduled job ag]", "subject": "Pddapp", "doc_type": "unknown", "topic": "\ud83d\udcac Conversations Table", "difficulty": "intermediate", "source_file": "Pddapp.pdf", "page_number": 10, "chunk_index": 4, "timestamp": "2026-03-02T15:05:36.756370", "word_count": 224}, "abf2ccbb_5": {"chunk_id": "abf2ccbb_5", "content": "2\u20e3 AI Suggestion Flow (Admin App)\n1. Admin enters FAQ\n2. API \u2192 AI Engine\n3. AI improves question/answer\n4. Admin reviews\n5. Save to DB\n3\u20e3 Analytics Processing\n\u25cf Every message stored\n\u25cf Scheduled job aggregates daily metrics\n\u25cf Dashboard pulls summarized data\n4\u20e3 Flutter Folder Structure\n\ud83d\udcf1\nAdmin App Structure\nlib/\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 core/\n\u2502 \u251c\u2500\u2500 constants/\n\u2502 \u251c\u2500\u2500 theme/\n\u2502 \u2514\u2500\u2500 utils/\n\u2502\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 features/\n\u2502 \u251c\u2500\u2500 auth/\n\u2502 \u251c\u2500\u2500 dashboard/\n\u2502 \u251c\u2500\u2500 chatbot/\n\u2502 \u251c\u2500\u2500 analytics/\n\u2502\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 services/\n\n\u2502 \u251c\u2500\u2500 api_service.dart\n\u2502 \u251c\u2500\u2500 auth_service.dart\n\u2502\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 models/\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 widgets/\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 main.dart\n\ud83d\udcf1\nConsumer App Structure\nlib/\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 core/\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 features/\n\u2502 \u251c\u2500\u2500 auth/\n\u2502 \u251c\u2500\u2500 home/\n\u2502 \u251c\u2500\u2500 chatbot_list/\n\u2502 \u251c\u2500\u2500 chat/\n\u2502\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 services/\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 models/\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 widgets/\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 main.dart\n\ud83d\udcb0\n5\u20e3 Monetization Strategy\n\ud83d\udcbc\nSaaS Subscription Model\n\ud83d\udd39 Free Tier\n\u25cf 1 chatbot\n\u25cf 100 conversations/month\n\u25cf Basic analytics\n\ud83d\udd39 Pro Tier ($29/month)\n\u25cf 5 chatbots\n\n\u25cf 10,000 conversations\n\u25cf AI suggestions\n\u25cf Advanced analytics\n\ud83d\udd39 Enterprise Tier ($199/month)\n\u25cf Unlimited chatbots\n\u25cf API access\n\u25cf Custom AI training\n\u25cf Dedicated support\n\ud83d\udcb0\nAdditional Revenue Streams\n\u25cf Per-message billing\n\u25cf AI customization add-on\n\u25cf White-label solution\n\u25cf Premium chatbot ranking in consumer app\n\ud83d\ude80\n6\u20e3 Startup Pitch Version\n\ud83c\udff7\nStartup Name (Example)\n\"SupportHub AI\"\n\ud83c\udfaf\nProblem [Context: Customers must visit different websites for support.\nBusinesses struggle to build intelligent chatbot systems.\n\ud83d\udca1\nSolution\nA dual-app AI-powered ecosystem where:\n\u25cf Businesses build smart chatbots easil]", "subject": "Pddapp", "doc_type": "unknown", "topic": "3\u20e3 Analytics Processing", "difficulty": "intermediate", "source_file": "Pddapp.pdf", "page_number": 13, "chunk_index": 5, "timestamp": "2026-03-02T15:05:36.756370", "word_count": 240}, "d616866b_6": {"chunk_id": "d616866b_6", "content": "Customers must visit different websites for support.\nBusinesses struggle to build intelligent chatbot systems.\n\ud83d\udca1\nSolution\nA dual-app AI-powered ecosystem where:\n\u25cf Businesses build smart chatbots easily.\n\u25cf Consumers access all company support in one unified app.\n\ud83e\udde0\nUnique Value Proposition\n\u25cf Multi-company support platform\n\u25cf AI-driven chatbot builder\n\u25cf Centralized customer support ecosystem\n\u25cf Real-time analytics for businesses\n\ud83d\udcc8\nMarket Opportunity\n\u25cf Global chatbot market growing rapidly\n\u25cf SMEs need affordable AI tools\n\u25cf Consumers demand centralized digital support\n\ud83d\udcb0\nRevenue Model\nSubscription SaaS + AI premium features\n\n\ud83d\ude80\nFuture Vision\n\u25cf AI voice chatbot\n\u25cf WhatsApp integration\n\u25cf Website plugin version\n\u25cf B2B marketplace for AI bots", "subject": "Pddapp", "doc_type": "unknown", "topic": "Solution", "difficulty": "intermediate", "source_file": "Pddapp.pdf", "page_number": 16, "chunk_index": 6, "timestamp": "2026-03-02T15:05:36.756925", "word_count": 109}, "a6d35a17_0": {"chunk_id": "a6d35a17_0", "content": "PS 7 \u2013 Women's Biological Cycle & Energy Planning\nThis document is a structured dataset designed for Retrieval-Augmented Generation\n(RAG) models. It explains the problem, domain concepts, system logic, and planning\nstrategies for applications that align productivity with women's biological cycles.\nThe dataset is intentionally written in clear, non-medical language to ensure ethical,\nexplainable, and safe AI usage.\n\nProblem Definition\nModern productivity tools assume consistent daily energy levels. However, biological\nrhythms, especially menstrual cycles, cause predictable variations in energy, focus, and\nmood.\nIgnoring these rhythms results in burnout, reduced efficiency, and poor planning decisions.\n\nIndustry Context\nWomen professionals often plan work without considering biological energy patterns.\nThere is a clear gap between health tracking applications and productivity planning tools.\n\nOverview of Menstrual Cycle\nThe menstrual cycle is a recurring biological process typically lasting around 28 days.\nIt can be divided into four primary phases: Menstrual, Follicular, Ovulation, and Luteal.\n\nMenstrual Phase Characteristics\nMenstrual phase usually spans days 1 to 5.\nEnergy levels are generally lower, and rest-focused planning is beneficial.\n\nFollicular Phase Characteristics\nThe follicular phase typically spans days 6 to 13.\nThis phase is associated with rising energy, creativity, and openness to new tasks. [Context: Ovulation Phase Characteristics\nOvulation typically occurs around days 14 and 15.\nEnergy and confidence peak, making it ideal for collaboration and communication tasks.\n\nLuteal Phase Characteristics\nT]", "subject": "Ps7 Cyclesync Rag Dataset", "doc_type": "unknown", "topic": "Problem Definition", "difficulty": "intermediate", "source_file": "PS7_CycleSync_RAG_Dataset.pdf", "page_number": 1, "chunk_index": 0, "timestamp": "2026-03-03T02:57:04.484483", "word_count": 223}, "9290367e_1": {"chunk_id": "9290367e_1", "content": "Ovulation Phase Characteristics\nOvulation typically occurs around days 14 and 15.\nEnergy and confidence peak, making it ideal for collaboration and communication tasks.\n\nLuteal Phase Characteristics\nThe luteal phase spans days 16 to 28.\nEnergy gradually decreases, making structured and analytical work more suitable.\n\nEnergy Variability Across Phases\nEnergy is not random but follows recurring biological patterns.\nTracking these patterns enables better alignment between work demands and capacity.\n\nMood and Cognitive Trends\nMood and emotional regulation also vary across cycle phases.\nUnderstanding mood trends improves self-awareness and planning accuracy.\n\nCycle Tracking Concepts\nCycle tracking involves logging period start dates and estimating cycle length.\nSimple rule-based models can estimate the current cycle phase.\n\nEnergy Logging Concepts\nDaily energy logging captures subjective energy levels on a fixed scale.\nOver time, this data enables phase-wise energy correlation.\n\nCorrelation Between Cycle and Energy\nCorrelation analysis reveals how energy aligns with specific cycle phases.\nThis correlation forms the basis for reliable planning recommendations.\n\nPersonal Baseline Energy\nEach individual has a unique baseline energy level.\nComparing phase energy to personal baseline avoids generic assumptions.\n\nConfidence-Based Insights\nPredictions must include confidence scores based on data availability.\nLow data volume should result in low-confidence insights. [Context: Explainable Planning Systems\nExplainable systems show users why a recommendation was made.\nTransparency builds trust and improves adoption.\n\nPlanning Logic \u2013 Work vs Rest\nPlanning recommendations shou]", "subject": "Ps7 Cyclesync Rag Dataset", "doc_type": "unknown", "topic": "Ovulation Phase Characteristics", "difficulty": "intermediate", "source_file": "PS7_CycleSync_RAG_Dataset.pdf", "page_number": 7, "chunk_index": 1, "timestamp": "2026-03-03T02:57:04.486520", "word_count": 225}, "0693ace9_2": {"chunk_id": "0693ace9_2", "content": "Explainable Planning Systems\nExplainable systems show users why a recommendation was made.\nTransparency builds trust and improves adoption.\n\nPlanning Logic \u2013 Work vs Rest\nPlanning recommendations should balance work intensity and recovery.\nDifferent phases support different types of tasks.\n\nWeekly Planning Strategy\nWeekly views help users distribute tasks according to predicted energy.\nThis reduces overload on low-capacity days.\n\nAgent-Based Reasoning\nAn agent-based system continuously observes, reasons, and adapts.\nIt differs from static dashboards or CRUD applications.\n\nEthics and Safety\nCycle-based planning tools must avoid medical claims.\nClear disclaimers and ethical data usage are mandatory.\n\nPrivacy-First Design\nSensitive biological data must remain private.\nAggregated or abstracted signals should be used for collaboration.\n\nUse in Enterprise Environments\nIn workplaces, energy-aware planning improves sustainability.\nPrivacy abstraction enables safe team coordination.\n\nRAG Usage Guidelines\nThis dataset is suitable for retrieval-based AI systems.\nIt provides factual, explainable, and non-sensitive reference material.\n\nConclusion\nAligning productivity with biological rhythms improves well-being and effectiveness.\nCycle-aware planning systems represent a new class of ethical productivity tools.", "subject": "Ps7 Cyclesync Rag Dataset", "doc_type": "unknown", "topic": "Explainable Planning Systems", "difficulty": "intermediate", "source_file": "PS7_CycleSync_RAG_Dataset.pdf", "page_number": 16, "chunk_index": 2, "timestamp": "2026-03-03T02:57:04.486520", "word_count": 167}, "d41d8cd9_0": {"chunk_id": "d41d8cd9_0", "content": "", "subject": "Java Se21 Sample Qp", "doc_type": "unknown", "topic": "General Concept", "difficulty": "intermediate", "source_file": "JAVA SE21 SAMPLE QP.pdf", "page_number": 1, "chunk_index": 0